Package: com.local.glassfolderstest3
Name: GlassFolders
Version: 0.7.4~beta2.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Beta 2.7 keeps the 40 pt independent Clear blur curve and all Liquid Glass baselines locked, while calibrating Clear neutral brightness/transmission separately for light and dark appearance. Light gets the larger correction; dark gets a smaller lift. Wallpaper remains the only chroma source; no chromatic tint is added.
Maintainer: kulinich
Author: kulinich
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0)
